# detail
Number of changes: 2

1. Modified | Assignment statement
   Changed the expression assigned to `r` from `abs(r).sum(axis=axis[0], keepdims=keepdims).min(keepdims=keepdims)` to `abs(r).sum(axis=axis[0], keepdims=True).min(axis=axis[1], keepdims=True)`.

2. Added | Conditional statement
   Added an `if keepdims is False:` check that executes `r = r.squeeze(axis=axis)` when the condition is satisfied.
